Q4: Verifying r=0.485 (insider net direction)
------------------------------------------------------------
   Cases with insider data + winner/trap outcome: 78
   Encoding: NET_BUYING=1, MIXED=0, NET_SELLING=-1
   REPORTED r=0.485 → COMPUTED r=0.4853 (n=78, p=0.000001)
   NET_BUYING:  n=5, win rate=100.0%
