   MIXED:       n=7, win rate=28.6%

Q5: Why 190 cases in SP500 export?
------------------------------------------------------------
   phase3-merged.json has 190 results (ALL outcomes)
   winner/trap subset: 103 cases
   Job 2 originally evaluated: 190 cases
   The 190 includes ALL outcomes (winner, trap, mixed, underperform)
   The r=0.564 was computed on the 103 winner/trap subset only

Q6: v1 vs v2 baseline trajectory differences
------------------------------------------------------------
   Agree: 52/80, Differ: 28/80 (35.0%)
   Was this known and reported? NO.
   The v1 and v2 baselines used DIFFERENT Opus agents evaluating
   the SAME financial summaries. The 35% disagreement rate shows
   significant stochasticity in the AI trajectory classification.
   This is a real methodological concern — the same input produces
   different outputs 35% of the time.

