METHODOLOGY NOTE:
All r-values use Spearman rank correlation with categorical encoding:
  Trajectory: improving=1.5, stable=1, deteriorating=0
  Outcome: winner=1, trap=-1
  Insider: NET_BUYING=1, MIXED=0, NET_SELLING=-1

No numeric 1-5 attractor scores exist. All reported r-values are
correlations between ordinal categorical variables, not continuous scores.

CONCERN: v1 vs v2 baseline disagreement rate of 35% indicates
significant AI evaluation stochasticity. The r-values may vary
substantially on re-evaluation.
